  message: "Satisfied in PR #1702 (dev ac651f01d5). The enclosing side was fixed by 907d2f25d3 (position); the target side now binds, in order, a LET-local in scope, THIS spec's definition by bare name (module_ops), then the resolver. The filed repro is the new test test_tlaplus.py::TestTlaplusSameNamedOperators: A.tla:Init -> A.tla:x, B.tla:Init -> B.tla:y, B.tla:Bar -> B.tla:Init (was -> A.tla:Init on dev 38f6c90533, re-observed 2026-10-17 before the fix)."  # a016
